# Direct dependencies for .venvs/asr_guided_se.
# One process must import NeMo 2.2.1 (TDTLossNumba) and SEMamba++ (nnAudio, and
# the fused scan's build tools). Do not include se.in or asr.in: NeMo 2.2.1
# requires numba==0.61.0, and that Numba rejects NumPy 2.2 and later.
# .venvs/se and .venvs/semambapp stay on numba 0.68.1 and numpy 2.5.4.
# mamba-ssm and causal-conv1d are built from requirements/official-assets.toml.
# openai-whisper==20240930 is installed after sync with --no-build-isolation.
